@startuml
title US-001 - Register organization and admin - SSD level 1
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Prospective Admin" as Admin
participant "Nexo" as System

note over System
  Password registration. The response is the same whether or not\n  the email is registered, so it cannot be used to find accounts.
end note
Admin -> System: Register organization and admin account
activate System
alt Request accepted
    System --> Admin: Check your email (confirmation link sent,\nor a notice if the email already has an account)
else Invalid required details
    System --> Admin: Validation errors; nothing created
end
deactivate System
Admin -> System: Open the emailed confirmation link
activate System
alt Link valid and not expired
    System --> Admin: Email confirmed; sign in
else Link wrong or expired
    System --> Admin: Link not valid; register again
end
deactivate System
@enduml
